{"version":1,"herramienta":"whisperx medium + wav2vec2 es (letras)","audio":"rinon-corteza.m4a","duracion":49.001,"texto":"La corteza renal es la región externa pardo-rojiza del riñón. Recibe entre el 90 y el 95% de flujo sanguíneo renal. Su parénquima está compuesto por los corpusculos renales, los tubulos contorneados, proximales y distales, los tubulos conectores y una densa red vascular. Histológicamente se organiza en rayos medulares, estiraciones compuestas por tubulos rectos y conductos con lectores, alternados con laberintos corticales, que son las zonas intermedias donde reposan los corpúsculos y los tubulos contorneados. Asimismo, la corteza se extiende hacia la médula rodeando las pirámides renales para formar columnas renales.","cues":[[0.0,"X"],[0.857,"H"],[0.917,"B"],[1.038,"C"],[1.258,"D"],[1.418,"B"],[1.478,"C"],[1.538,"B"],[1.598,"D"],[1.678,"H"],[1.758,"X"],[1.919,"B"],[2.099,"D"],[2.259,"C"],[2.379,"B"],[2.439,"E"],[2.539,"B"],[2.68,"C"],[2.74,"B"],[3.08,"D"],[3.34,"B"],[3.48,"E"],[3.721,"B"],[3.781,"C"],[3.881,"B"],[3.961,"D"],[4.061,"C"],[4.141,"H"],[4.261,"C"],[4.382,"B"],[4.602,"X"],[5.062,"C"],[5.203,"B"],[5.283,"C"],[5.363,"A"],[6.003,"C"],[6.084,"B"],[6.604,"C"],[6.704,"H"],[6.764,"X"],[7.085,"C"],[7.145,"H"],[7.205,"X"],[7.946,"C"],[8.126,"H"],[8.206,"F"],[8.266,"E"],[8.406,"B"],[8.587,"C"],[8.747,"E"],[8.867,"C"],[8.967,"D"],[9.067,"H"],[9.187,"X"],[9.648,"B"],[9.708,"F"],[9.788,"A"],[9.848,"B"],[10.128,"C"],[10.208,"D"],[10.449,"B"],[10.589,"D"],[10.689,"E"],[10.769,"A"],[10.969,"C"],[11.069,"B"],[11.17,"E"],[11.47,"B"],[11.61,"E"],[11.69,"B"],[11.85,"E"],[11.91,"B"],[12.091,"A"],[12.151,"F"],[12.211,"B"],[12.331,"F"],[12.391,"E"],[12.471,"B"],[12.611,"C"],[12.691,"B"],[12.751,"D"],[12.832,"C"],[12.892,"B"],[12.992,"X"],[13.212,"E"],[13.292,"B"],[13.452,"F"],[13.673,"E"],[13.753,"B"],[14.253,"C"],[14.353,"D"],[14.433,"E"],[14.514,"B"],[14.774,"E"],[14.874,"B"],[14.934,"C"],[15.014,"A"],[15.074,"D"],[15.134,"H"],[15.194,"B"],[15.355,"C"],